la stazione ISS. La conquista dello spazio lo porterà a scrivere un nuovo, sorprendente capitolo della sua storia..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Head in the Stars","overview":"Ali, a thirty-something from the suburbs, still lives with his mother and his 8-year-old daughter. Lazy and without any particular ambition, he scrapes by doing odd jobs as a fast-food delivery driver. Following a delivery, he finds himself, by a twist of fate, propelled into space aboard the ISS space station. The conquest of space is about to write a surprising and unprecedented chapter in its history..."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Ali, trentenaire de banlieue, vit encore chez sa mère avec sa fille de 8 ans. Flemmard, sans ambition particulière, il vivote grâce à des petits jobs de livreur de fast-food. À la suite d’une livraison, il va, par un accident du destin, se retrouver propulsé dans l’espace, à bord de la station ISS. La conquête spatiale s’apprête à écrire un chapitre surprenant et inédit de son histoire…","tagline":"Ils étaient préparés à tout, sauf à lui."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bzCQVQ4WM4jfvttHQSvD6F2gA97.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sLSV8oTUl4FCvaTn6W3gANhxDyj.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1035459,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bzCQVQ4WM4jfvttHQSvD6F2gA97.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bzCQVQ4WM4jfvttHQSvD6F2gA97.jpg","language":"it","width":520,"height":780},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bzCQVQ4WM4jfvttHQSvD6F2gA97.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bzCQVQ4WM4jfvttHQSvD6F2gA97.jpg","language":"it","width":520,"height":780}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"fr":{"status":"available","selec